    {
      "box": [
        42.19674301147461,
        137.0576629638672,
        332.5527648925781,
        147.8629608154297
      ],
      "text": "27\nWhat point does the writer make in the first paragraph?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        65.74842834472656,
        157.6653594970703,
        329.6418762207031,
        167.8158721923828
      ],
      "text": "A\nWisdom appears to be unique to the human race.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        66.40264892578125,
        170.42254638671875,
        400.0105895996094,
        204.77691650390625
      ],
      "text": "B-\nAbasic assumption about wisdom may be wrong.\nC\nConcepts of wisdom may depend on the society we belong to.\nD_\nThere is still much to be discovered about the nature of wisdom.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.196773529052734,
        222.10537719726562,
        443.2950134277344,
        254.1752471923828
      ],
      "text": "28\nWhat does Igor Grossmann suggest about the ability to make wise decisions?\nA__ Itcan vary greatly from one person to another.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        66.4027099609375,
        254.8160858154297,
        345.0484619140625,
        263.329345703125
      ],
      "text": "B__\nEarlier research into it was based on unreliable data.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        66.4027099609375,
        267.90032958984375,
        394.10662841796875,
        278.05078125
      ],
      "text": "C_\nThe importance of certain influences on it was underestimated.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        66.4027099609375,
        280.9845886230469,
        435.23504638671875,
        291.4624938964844
      ],
      "text": "D_\nVarious branches of psychology define it according to their own criteria.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        41.86970138549805,
        306.4989013671875,
        452.689453125,
        316.9767761230469
      ],
      "text": "29\nAccording to the third paragraph, Grossmann claims that the level of wisdom an\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        66.4027099609375,
        319.5831604003906,
        145.39898681640625,
        327.7690124511719
      ],
      "text": "individual shows\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        65.74849700927734,
        339.86376953125,
        292.5970153808594,
        360.8067932128906
      ],
      "text": "A\ncan be greater than they think it is.\nB\nwill be different in different circumstances.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        66.07563781738281,
        365.37811279296875,
        383.6308288574219,
        390.2513122558594
      ],
      "text": "C_\nmay be determined by particular aspects of their personality.\nD _ should develop over time as a result of their life experiences.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        41.86973190307617,
        398.4158630371094,
        395.17437744140625,
